{"message":"I can help with this, but I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and the email address on your Rho-Bank profile. Then I’ll ask you to confirm two additional identity details.

Based on the currently listed products, $25,000 qualifies for the Gold Account savings rate of 5.5% APY, provided you maintain at least $10,000; the Platinum Account offers 6.5% APY but requires a $50,000 minimum balance, so it would not be suitable for $25,000. The Gold Account requires a $5,000 opening deposit and allows up to 20 withdrawals per month.

For your Light Blue Account, the early-closure fee is $15 if it was opened within the past 30 days; otherwise, there is no early-closure fee. Its balance must be $0 unless the applicable fee can be deducted, and it must have no pending transactions. We should also open your replacement checking account before closing Light Blue, because opening a personal savings account requires an active checking account."}

